      ],
      "source": "https://www.carlisle-nicholascounty.org/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Carlisle is home to the Daniel Boone Cabin, the pioneer’s last Kentucky residence from 1795 to 1799.",
